WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:09.217
A bamboo shoot sprouting
before the plums flower?

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:18.101
What's this?

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:41.124
Um...

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.295
may I ask who you might be?

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:19.370
What a beautiful princess!

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:24.626
Heaven must have sent her
to me as a blessing.

